\textbf{$\ML$-formulas evaluated on Kripke structures.}
We have a higher lower bound with modal logic monotone fragments. To derive this lower bound, we use the theorem below.
\begin{theorem}[Theorems 32 and 10 in  \cite{DBLP:journals/jalc/EllulKSW05}]
