$(Y_{\sigma} \, \lambda F \ldot e)$ is avoided and $\pr e'$ generates the value $[-1,1]$.


In the second case we use the more standard rule: 
\[
(Y_{\sigma} (\lambda F \ldot \langle e \mid s, n \rangle),\, w) \to 
