\begin{corollary}
\label{coro:connected-inside-blob}
    Let $B$ be a blob in any optimal blob-tree $S$. Let $T$ be the MST. Then:
\begin{enumerate}[\rm(a)]
\item
A path in $T$ that leaves $B$ never comes back to $B$.
    \item 
The subgraph of $T$ induced by the points in $B$ is connected.
\item
No MST edge with both endpoints outside $B$ intersects $B$.
