%\paragraph{Wall problems.}

%This directly defines two types of subproblems \texttt{chord}$[a,b]$ is an optimal solution for \(V_{ab}\) where \(ab\) is a valid chord or entry digon of the solution and \texttt{edge}$[u]$ is an optimal solution for $V_u$ if the edge \(uu'\) is part of the solution.
