LR-triangles, RL-triangles, and exit-triangles are \defn{valid triangles.} %In all other cases the triangle is invalid.
For a valid triangle, let \(X^+_{abc}=X^+_{ab} \cup X^+_{ac} \cup X^+_{bc}\).

