    \caption{Performance comparison between ResNet, ViT, and our interpretable embedding-based models using linear regression (LR) and LightGBM (LGBM). Lower MAE ($\downarrow$) and RMSE ($\downarrow$), and higher $R^2$ ($\uparrow$), indicate better performance. Our method achieves the best results across all three metrics.}
